### Texture pipeline

Use the actual engine's supported PBR workflow.

Where supported, implement:

- KTX2/Basis Universal compression.
- Correct color-space handling.
- Proper normal-map conventions.
- Appropriate roughness and metallic values.
- Mipmaps.
- Anisotropic filtering where beneficial.
- Texture atlases.
- Trim sheets.
- Material reuse.
- Reduced draw calls.
- Efficient GPU memory consumption.

Verify the existing engine supports the chosen format and loader before introducing new build dependencies.

Do not blindly copy a Three.js implementation into Babylon.js or vice versa.

